Description: MiniOS integration for the Thunar file manager
 Adds localized Thunar custom actions for MiniOS modules. The GTK frontend
 delegates module creation, extraction, activation, and deactivation to
 minios-tools and keeps the user's existing Thunar custom actions intact.
